  "description": "LoRaWAN 1.0.x for IoTCom.Net: PHYPayload codec, AES-CMAC MIC and payload encryption, OTAA/ABP, MAC commands, regional parameters (EU868, US915, AS923-2) and time on air, the Semtech UDP packet-forwarder protocol (gateway and server side), a light network server, a Class A end-device MAC, Cayenne LPP and a gateway/device simulator. The codec is mirrored by a fuzzed Rust crate through shared conformance vectors. Built by Gravicode Studios, led by Kang Fadhil.",
